model {
  extend basalt.poolRuntime {
    metadata {
      constraint "The node requests Home timing only for an HTTP request collector, preserves legacy and error replies, and forwards at most six closed bounded stage records in a private HTTP response header before the first body write. Invalid diagnostic metadata never changes a complete dispatch result. The Worker logs only validated stage, milliseconds and outcome and strips the header from client responses. No extra dispatch, provider call, retry or persistence is added. Source updates retain the private timing header and response behavior. The opt-in timing flag travels beside the scheduler context on the Home dispatch request without changing that context. The Home dispatch request carries the flag together with the names of the ready model-call plugins."
    }
  }
}
